    "description" : "Accounts, product catalogue, and the gRPC-backed debit. Generated from the service's controllers. Set {{baseUrl}} to the gateway (http://localhost:8080) to go through the edge instead of hitting the service directly. Authorization is disabled by default: enable it and set {{accessToken}} once gateway.security.enabled=true.",
